{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05924","headline":"陇头吟 · 王维","name":"陇头吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安少年游侠客，夜上戍楼看太白。\n陇头明月迥临关，陇上行人夜吹笛。\n关西老将不胜愁，驻马听之双泪流。\n身经大小百余战，麾下偏裨万户侯。\n苏武才爲典属国，节旄落尽海西头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"方 牧"}